      },
      "message": "test(app): use a word that is not a kind in the kind refusal test\n\nPR #3279 made \"router\" a legal machine kind word (it reads as a mill),\nso parse_mch no longer refuses it. The test\na_kind_that_is_not_a_kind_refuses_at_the_door still used \"router\" as\nthe illegal word, and the post-merge gate went red (run 45007275047).\nUse \"drill press\", which is not a kind or an alias. The product does\nnot change.\n\nFixes #3337\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
